<title>JAPAN: Daiichi Corp - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiichi Corp - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.61		vs	    3.70</p>
<p> Operating   loss 326 million	 vs	prft 414 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 461 million	 vs	prft 244 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 454 million	 vs	loss 108 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 6.26 yen	  vs	  loss 1.50 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     73 million	  vs	  73 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiichi Corp is involved in real estate sales/financing and is different from the retailer of the same name.</p>
</text>
